{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11302370","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11302370","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1130237001:1":{"text":"えぇ、最近の武闘場ではファイターの個人戦や団体戦がたくさん用意されてるの。","source_cn":"是的，武斗场在近期安排了很多场角斗士单人对战和团队对战。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C8F58A7AADB7DA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130237002:1":{"text":"そういう試合はエキシビションマッチみたいなもので、主な目的はみんなに戦歌祭の雰囲気をもっと味わってもらうことなの。","source_cn":"这些对战属于表演性质，主要目的是让大家更沉浸于战歌节的气氛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DCBA435B2752C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130237003:1":{"text":"自分の好きな勇士に賭けてもいいし、直接試合に参加してもいいのよ。","source_cn":"客人可以选择下注自己喜欢的勇士，也可以直接参与到对战中。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D4C671BD881FA9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:员工亚丝":{"text":"スタッフのヤリス","source":"员工亚丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}